    "created_at": "2020-05-16T05:43:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-16T05:43:33Z",
    "body": "> This issue tracks [**safelisting**](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/system-state.html#safelisted-scheme) of \"**ssb**\", \"**dat**\", \"**ipfs**\", \"**ipns**\" and \"**dweb**\" protocols within HTML spec.\r\n\r\nThe dweb community reported interest for \"cabal\" and \"hyper\" schemes too.\r\n\r\nAll of them are now registered at IANA https://www.iana.org/assignments/uri-schemes/uri-schemes.xhtml",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
